This project links against and redistributes binaries from third-party MIT /
Apache-2.0 projects, which are fetched at setup time and are NOT part of this
repository (see engines/README.md):

- llama.cpp (MIT)            https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp
- stable-diffusion.cpp (MIT) https://github.com/leejet/stable-diffusion.cpp
- pdf.js (Apache-2.0)        https://github.com/mozilla/pdf.js
- Electron and its dependencies (MIT) https://electronjs.org
